## Original source code

Original pear HTML, CSS, and JavaScript source code created for this project is licensed under the **Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0)**.

This includes original files in `prototype/` other than bundled third-party dependencies, the root `index.html`, and original test code in `tests/`.

See `LICENSE-CODE-MPL-2.0.txt` or https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

The Exhibit B “Incompatible With Secondary Licenses” notice is **not** applied.

