Original prose, research/design documents, governance templates, fictional scenarios, and original visual/design material are licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)**.

This includes authored material in `docs/`, `governance/`, `content/`, `README.md`, and `ATTRIBUTION.md`.

See `LICENSE-DOCS-CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt` or https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/.

For adapted material, provide appropriate credit, link the applicable license, and indicate changes. CC BY-SA adaptations must use the same or a compatible license as required by its terms.

